 of your sculpt as a stamp. Sculpt in mixed-reality passthrough at your real desk. Export to Blender with one press.", "short_description": "Real clay. Your room. Sculpt without limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emotionull.art/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emotionull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emotionull.art/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345650630966511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "888881050951536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785211200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1440915281440045", "version": "0.2.333"}, "id": "1278478724173176", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1440915281440045"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Visuals and lag, ready for 0.2.333:\r\n\r\nEdges in videos and photos: I checked your real recordings, and the clay outlines were stair-stepped. Videos and photos now get an anti-aliasing pass (FXAA) that only touches edges, once per frame or photo. It doesn\u2019t affect what you see in the headset.\r\nIn tests, 2.9\u00d7 more video edge pixels and 1.7\u00d7 more photo edge pixels now land between clay and background, and no pixel inside the clay changed.\r\nVideo colours: your videos carried no colour-space tag, so some players guess wrong and shift greens and reds. New videos are tagged. I can\u2019t test this on the PC, so I\u2019ll check your next recording.\r\nLighter clay on every headset: the clay is limited by per-pixel shading, so I moved the ambient lighting to per-vertex. The picture is unchanged: the four Looks match 0.2.332 to within 1 colour level.\r\nThe speed gain still has to be measured on the headset. The headset benchmark now has a matching phase that times the old per-pixel version against the new one in the same run.\r\nSky backdrop: it showed visible banding (stripes across the gradient) on the headset\u2019s 8-bit display. A tiny fixed dither removes them. Sky is the default backdrop on Quest 2.", "created_date": 1793761042, "id": "1440915281440045", "version": "0.2.333", "version_code": 333, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1440915281440045"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "quest 2 optimizing, and new looks in material tab", "created_date": 1793558264, "id": "1438707921660781", "version": "0.2.332", "version_code": 332, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1440915281440045"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Spline stops working after switching layers. Found and fixed. The curve\u2019s markers hang off the layer you draw on. When that layer was later destroyed (deleted and the trash emptied, merged, or replaced by New, Load or joining a room), the markers went with it, and every spline point after that crashed. That\u2019s why a restart was the only cure. Now the markers return to a safe place when a curve is done. If the layer goes mid-curve, that curve is dropped and the tool keeps working. The new check reproduces the crash with the fix switched off and passes with it on.\r\n\r\n\u201cFill closed spline\u201d: added as a fifth spline mode, Fill. Draw a loop and it becomes a flat slab as thick as your brush. Hold the support trigger to cut a slab-shaped hole instead. Concave shapes keep their notches empty, it\u2019s one undo step, and a straight line is refused. The panel row now reads Tube / Hollow / Fill / Stamps / Trim; I checked the screenshot and it lays out fine.", "created_date": 1793525937, "id": "1438295561702017", "version": "0.2.331", "version_code": 331, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1440915281440045"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1793402901, "id": "1436868231844750", "version": "0.2.330", "version_code": 330, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1440915281440045"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "smoothing fixes", "created_date": 1793389748, "id": "1436740198524220", "version": "0.2.329", "version_code": 329, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}